Version vE3: 1st June, 2024
+ Huge performance improvements;
+ Added "Windows Process Status" - The presence will always show for users what you're doing so take care of your privacy;
+ Added "Windows CPU & RAM Usage status" - Compatible with your own application ID and images (direct url images (.png/.gif (for example) also works);
+ Fixed some bugs when switching through features;
+ Fixed a bug that triggers an "Application ID ERROR" when the user clicks too fast to open a feature;

Version vD3 Hotfix: 20th March, 2023

+ Some fixes;
- Temporarily removed "Dynamic Background" feature (It was causing issues with people that use "Wallpaper Engine");
